<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
license:CC0-1.0
copyright-holders:superctr

The JD-990 front panel.  The display is the 320 x 80 dot module behind its cover; every key of
the right-hand block has a lamp, led<4 x column + row> of the key matrix, and the MIDI MESSAGE bar
is led7.  The volume knob and the dial push: PREVIEW and the sound list.
Coordinates are tenths of a millimetre on the 482 x 88.1 mm plate.
-->
